# The original is gone: the question says where it was, Recover opens the copy with no name, and Save As starts at the old folder and name.
@recovery
@file "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "dear sir"
cmd Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
type ", and madam"
autosave
rm "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
restart
expect recover "Quill found changes to LETTER.QLD that were not saved, from 25 Nov 2026 at 2:32 PM. LETTER.QLD is no longer in C:\\DOCS\\." default Yes
answer recover
dump
cmd SaveAs
expect file SaveAs folder="C:\\DOCS\\" name="LETTER.QLD" type=0
cancel
